      "raw_text": "Western Central Pacific:\nShowers and thunderstorms are a little better organized in \nassociation with a broad area of low pressure located just west of \nthe International Date Line, several hundred miles west of Johnston \nAtoll. Some development of this system is possible over the next few \ndays while it moves east-northeastward at 10 to 15 mph. By the \nmiddle of next week, however, strong upper-level winds should limit \nany additional development.\n* Formation chance through 48 hours...low...20 percent. \n* Formation chance through 7 days...low...30 percent.",
