    "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=15.9,90.3",
    "official_link": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=15.9,90.3",
    "country_code": null,
    "payload": {
      "item_type": "disturbance",
      "source": "jtwc_abio",
      "source_key": "jtwc_abio|north_indian_ocean_area|invest_98b",
      "content_hash": "1df9c8707d75e4d1",
      "platform_summary": "15.9N 90.3E | winds 23-28 kt | 1004 mb | HIGH",
      "platform_location": "15.9N 90.3E",
      "wind": "23-28 kt",
      "risk_48h": null,
      "risk_7d": null,
      "next_update": null,
      "raw_text": "(1) THE AREA OF CONVECTION (INVEST 98B) PREVIOUSLY LOCATED NEAR \n14.4N 88.8E IS NOW LOCATED NEAR 15.9N 90.3E, APPROXIMATELY 290 NM NORTH-\nNORTHWEST OF PORT BLAIR, INDIA. MULTISPECTRAL SATELLITE IMAGERY (MSI) \nDEPICTS A SLOWLY CONSOLIDATING, PARTIALLY EXPOSED LOW LEVEL CIRCULATION \nCENTER (LLCC) WITH DEEP CONVECTION CONFINED TO THE NORTHERN PERIPHERY \nAND CONVECTIVE BANDING FORMING TO THE EAST AND SOUTH. A 240234Z ASCAT \nPASS REVEALS WINDS OF 25KTS TO THE SOUTHWEST OF THE STORM CENTER. \nENVIRONMENTAL ANALYSIS INDICATES A FAVORABLE AREA FOR DEVELOPMENT WITH \nMODERATE VERTICAL WIND SHEAR (15-20KTS), GOOD POLEWARD AND EQUATORWARD \nOUTFLOW, AND VERY WARM SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURES (29-30C). GLOBAL \nDETERMINISTIC AND ENSEMBLE MODELS ARE IN AGREEMENT OF FORMATION WITHIN \n24 HOURS AND A REVERSAL IN STORM MOTION TOWARD THE WEST. MAXIMUM \nSUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE ESTIMATED AT 23 TO 28 KNOTS. MINIMUM SEA \nLEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED TO BE NEAR 1004 MB. THE POTENTIAL FOR THE \nDEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE WITHIN THE NEXT 24 HOURS \nREMAINS HIGH. SEE REF A (WTIO21 PGTW 241100) FOR FURTHER DETAILS.",
      "metadata": {
        "basin_section": "NORTH INDIAN OCEAN AREA (MALAY PENINSULA WEST TO COAST OF AFRICA)",
        "invest_id": "98B",
        "lat": 15.9,
        "lon": 90.3,
        "wind_kt_min": 23,
        "wind_kt_max": 28,
        "wind_kt": 28,
        "pressure_mb": 1004,
        "development_phrase": "REMAINS",
        "development_level": "HIGH",
        "bulletin_issue_at": "2026-10-24T18:00:00+00:00"
      }
    },
